# Keep root docker build context small (ship-to-market + Dockerfile).
# The image only needs products/ghcr-console/**.
**
!products/
!products/ghcr-console/
!products/ghcr-console/**
products/ghcr-console/node_modules
products/ghcr-console/.next
products/ghcr-console/tests
# Self-hosted CI dispatcher image (ops/self-hosted-ci/Dockerfile, built on Railway).
!ops/
!ops/self-hosted-ci/
!ops/self-hosted-ci/**
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log*
